# ═══════════════ DEATH ═══════════════
death.pvp.1=<red>⚔ {killer} showed {victim} who's boss!</red>
death.pvp.2=<gold>{killer}</gold> sent <red>{victim}</red> to the spirit world!
death.pvp.3=<dark_red>{victim}</dark_red> couldn't withstand {killer}'s power!

death.lava.1=<red>🔥 %player_name% tried to hug lava. It didn't work.</red>
death.lava.2=<gold>%player_name%</gold> turned into barbecue... not the tastiest.
death.lava.3=<dark_red>%player_name%</dark_red> learned to admire lava from a distance.

death.fall.1=<gray>💥 %player_name% thought they could fly. Spoiler: no.</gray>
death.fall.2=<red>☠ %player_name%</red> lost the battle with gravity.
death.fall.3=<yellow>%player_name%</yellow> learned physics the hard way.

death.explosion.1=<red>💥 %player_name% exploded!</red>
death.explosion.2=<gold>%player_name%</gold> got too close to explosives.

death.drowning.1=<blue>💧 %player_name% drowned. Fish say hi.</blue>
death.drowning.2=<aqua>%player_name%</aqua> never learned to breathe underwater.

death.fire.1=<red>🔥 %player_name% burned. That was hot.</red>
death.fire.2=<gold>%player_name%</gold> became a torch for the server.

death.void.1=<dark_purple>🌌 %player_name% fell into the void. Farewell, traveller.</dark_purple>
death.void.2=<dark_gray>%player_name%</dark_gray> literally left this world.

death.player_kill.1=<red>💀 %player_name%</red> flew to a better world. One-way ticket.
death.player_kill.2=<gold>⚰ %player_name%</gold> got hit by fate... or a pickaxe.
death.player_kill.3=<gray>%player_name%</gray> unexpectedly met their death.

death.mob.ZOMBIE.1=<dark_red>%player_name%</dark_red> was in love with a zombie... doesn't matter now!
death.mob.ZOMBIE.2=<gold>%player_name%</gold> became a zombie's favourite meal!
death.mob.ZOMBIE.3=<gray>%player_name% tried to befriend a zombie. It didn't work.</gray>
death.mob.SKELETON.1=<gray>%player_name%</gray> became target practice for skeletons!
death.mob.SKELETON.2=<white>%player_name%</white> met skeleton arrows face to face!
death.mob.SKELETON.3=<yellow>%player_name%</yellow> learned that bones can be deadly.
death.mob.CREEPER.1=<green>%player_name%</green> got too close to a green explosive friend!
death.mob.CREEPER.2=<yellow>%player_name%</yellow> turned into a pile of blocks after meeting a creeper!
death.mob.CREEPER.3=<red>%player_name%</red> miscalculated the distance from a creeper!
death.mob.SPIDER.1=<dark_purple>%player_name%</dark_purple> got tangled in a web and lost!
death.mob.SPIDER.2=<red>%player_name%</red> was bitten by a spider!
death.mob.SPIDER.3=<gray>%player_name%</gray> learned that spiders aren't friends.
death.mob.WITCH.1=<purple>%player_name%</purple> met a witch and her potions!
death.mob.WITCH.2=<dark_red>%player_name%</dark_red> became a victim of witch magic!
death.mob.WITCH.3=<gray>%player_name%</gray> didn't appreciate the power of potions.
death.mob.ENDERMAN.1=<black>%player_name%</black> met an enderman... and vanished almost instantly!
death.mob.ENDERMAN.2=<purple>%player_name%</purple> was caught by an enderman's gaze!
death.mob.ENDERMAN.3=<gray>%player_name%</gray> learned that looking at endermen is dangerous.
death.mob.WARDEN.1=<black>%player_name%</black> heard the Warden's heartbeat!
death.mob.WARDEN.2=<dark_gray>%player_name%</dark_gray> didn't run fast enough!
death.mob.WARDEN.3=<red>%player_name%</red> became a victim of the Warden!
death.mob.default.1=<dark_red>%player_name%</dark_red> was killed by some evil mob!
death.mob.default.2=<gold>%player_name%</gold> became a victim of a mysterious creature!
death.mob.default.3=<gray>%player_name%</gray> felt death.

